# Scoped ignore for `docker build -f apps/oob-listener/Dockerfile .` (BuildKit reads
# <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to a root .dockerignore). Keeps the build context small and
# forces a clean, reproducible install+build inside the image rather than shipping host artifacts.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.next
.git
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
